{"id":"9253008af6fe0ca2","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination.md","title":"省略绑定改名会破坏同名端式的消切","display":"ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination — 省略绑定改名会破坏同名端式的消切","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination","aliases":["72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination"],"display":"ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination — 省略绑定改名会破坏同名端式的消切","depends_on":["[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","[[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]]","[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","[[72-df-sequent-validity]]","[[72-df-proof-tree]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I §2.3.1–2.3.2, print32/PDF44, Feferman example; explicit local derivation and no-cut invariant","source_kind":"source-driven-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-context-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument recorded; source correspondence and finite regression distinguished","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_23":"显式列出反例演算载集、初始式、带标签Cut和扩充操作的来源"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination — 省略绑定改名会破坏同名端式的消切"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"855e440d9df6186d\" href=\"?note=855e440d9df6186d\" title=\"72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion\">72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c014dab66d624c8\" href=\"?note=5c014dab66d624c8\" title=\"72-df-propositional-evaluation\">72-df-propositional-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ba1b086fe1d56f25\" href=\"?note=ba1b086fe1d56f25\" title=\"72-df-sequent-validity\">72-df-sequent-validity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I §2.3.1–2.3.2, print32/PDF44, Feferman example; explicit local derivation and no-cut invariant"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-driven-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-context-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument recorded; source correspondence and finite regression distinguished"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23","html":"显式列出反例演算载集、初始式、带标签Cut和扩充操作的来源"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in R\">\\(p\\in R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_R(p)=2\">\\(a_R(p)=2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z,u,v,a,b\\in V\">\\(x,y,z,u,v,a,b\\in V\\)</span> 两两互异。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_0\">\\(\\mathcal C_0\\)</span> 从现行 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 中仅删去 AL/AR 规则，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\mathcal C_1\\)</span> 再加入 Cut；二者保留原有部分自由代入及任意公式恒等初始式。下式所有公式是本册自由语法树，不能默认取α商。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rules}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rules}\\)</span> 及演算加规则操作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c60a11e47ac58326\" href=\"?note=c60a11e47ac58326\" title=\"72-df-gentzen-system\">72-df-gentzen-system</a> 的既有接口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"855e440d9df6186d\" href=\"?note=855e440d9df6186d\" title=\"72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion\">72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\vdash q\">\\(\\mathcal C\\vdash q\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"81c9c855e009a6d4\" href=\"?note=81c9c855e009a6d4\" title=\"72-df-proof-tree\">72-df-proof-tree</a> 的有限带标签证明存在性，分别以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_0,\\mathcal C_1,\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal C_0,\\mathcal C_1,\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 为演算参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA&amp;:=p(x,y),\\qquad B:=\\exists y\\exists x\\,p(y,x),\\qquad C:=\\exists u\\exists v\\,p(u,v),\\\\\nq&amp;:=\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle B\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_0&amp;:=\\langle\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma),\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma,\n\\operatorname{Rules}(\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma)\\setminus\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_1&amp;:=\\mathcal C_0+\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA&amp;:=p(x,y),\\qquad B:=\\exists y\\exists x\\,p(y,x),\\qquad C:=\\exists u\\exists v\\,p(u,v),\\\\\nq&amp;:=\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle B\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_0&amp;:=\\langle\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma),\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma,\n\\operatorname{Rules}(\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma)\\setminus\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_1&amp;:=\\mathcal C_0+\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(q),\\qquad\n\\mathcal C_1\\vdash q,\\qquad\\neg(\\mathcal C_0\\vdash q),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma\\vdash q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(q),\\qquad\n\\mathcal C_1\\vdash q,\\qquad\\neg(\\mathcal C_0\\vdash q),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma\\vdash q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 I§2.3.1–2.3.2，印刷32/PDF44，给出同一个 Feferman 例来说明变量约定不是可省略的说明。本地含Cut证明可具体构造：从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow A\">\\(A\\Rightarrow A\\)</span> 先对 v、u 作合法存在引入，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow C\">\\(A\\Rightarrow C\\)</span>；从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(a,b)\\Rightarrow p(a,b)\">\\(p(a,b)\\Rightarrow p(a,b)\\)</span> 依次引入 B 的内外两个存在量词，再在左边以 b、a 作本征变量消去 C 的两个存在量词，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\Rightarrow B\">\\(C\\Rightarrow B\\)</span>，最后作 C 切。</p>\n<p>无α且无Cut时，由端式向叶看，左边只能有原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(x,y)\">\\(p(x,y)\\)</span> 的副本，右边只能有 B 及它的合法存在实例。对 B 的外层 y 作实例 t，合法性迫使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)\">\\(x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)\\)</span>，所得内层体为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(t,x)\">\\(p(t,x)\\)</span>；再实例化内层 x 也不会改变 t。因此任何到达原子的右公式，其第一参数均不含自由 x，不可能与左原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(x,y)\">\\(p(x,y)\\)</span> 相同。交换、弱化、收缩保持该性质；非原子恒等初始式也不可能出现，因为左边始终只有该原子。没有任何可用的初始叶，故不存在有限无切证明。这是一般不可能性论证，不是有限深度搜索。</p>\n<p>修复后直接无切证明为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow p(x,y)\">\\(A\\Rightarrow p(x,y)\\)</span>，再到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow\\exists z\\,p(x,z)\">\\(A\\Rightarrow\\exists z\\,p(x,z)\\)</span>，再到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\Rightarrow\\exists y\\exists z\\,p(y,z)\">\\(A\\Rightarrow\\exists y\\exists z\\,p(y,z)\\)</span>；最后 AR 将绑定 z 改为目标绑定 x。没有捕获自由变量，也没有改动目标端式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-gentzen-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion","status":"resolved","id":"855e440d9df6186d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-evaluation","status":"resolved","id":"5c014dab66d624c8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-evaluation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-validity","status":"resolved","id":"ba1b086fe1d56f25","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-validity]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-gentzen-system","status":"resolved","id":"c60a11e47ac58326","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$、$\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma$、$\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{Rules}$ 及演算加规则操作 $+$ 取 [[72-df-gentzen-system]] 的既有接口，$\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion","status":"resolved","id":"855e440d9df6186d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)$、$\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma$、$\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma$、$\\operatorname{Rules}$ 及演算加规则操作 $+$ 取 [[72-df-gentzen-system]] 的既有接口，$\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"81c9c855e009a6d4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C\\vdash q$ 取 [[72-df-proof-tree]] 的有限带标签证明存在性，分别以 $\\mathcal C_0,\\mathcal C_1,\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma$ 为演算参数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"a_R(p)=2","display":false},{"tex":"x,y,z,u,v,a,b\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rules}","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\vdash q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_0,\\mathcal C_1,\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nA&:=p(x,y),\\qquad B:=\\exists y\\exists x\\,p(y,x),\\qquad C:=\\exists u\\exists v\\,p(u,v),\\\\\nq&:=\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow_\\Sigma\\langle B\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_0&:=\\langle\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Sigma),\\mathrm{Ax}_\\Sigma,\n\\operatorname{Rules}(\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma)\\setminus\\widehat{\\operatorname{Alpha}}_\\Sigma\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathcal C_1&:=\\mathcal C_0+\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cut}}_\\Sigma.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ValidSeq}_\\Sigma(q),\\qquad\n\\mathcal C_1\\vdash q,\\qquad\\neg(\\mathcal C_0\\vdash q),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{LK}^{-}_\\Sigma\\vdash q.","display":true},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow C","display":false},{"tex":"p(a,b)\\Rightarrow p(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"C\\Rightarrow B","display":false},{"tex":"p(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin\\operatorname{VarTerm}(t)","display":false},{"tex":"p(t,x)","display":false},{"tex":"p(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow p(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow\\exists z\\,p(x,z)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\Rightarrow\\exists y\\exists z\\,p(y,z)","display":false}],"bytes":3758,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"I章新增5项：[[72-df-formula-alpha-equivalence]] · [[72-df-sequent-alpha-conversion]] · [[72-df-strong-inference-size]] · [[72-ex-alpha-conversion-cut-elimination]] · [[72-lem-formula-alpha-invariance]]"}],"outgoing":["c60a11e47ac58326","855e440d9df6186d","5c014dab66d624c8","ba1b086fe1d56f25","81c9c855e009a6d4"]}